<title>UK: TABLE-London Clubs yr profits edge higher.</title>
<headline>TABLE-London Clubs yr profits edge higher.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 30, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		 16.0		  vs 15.0</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	  5.625		 vs  5.25</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence)  8.25		  vs  7.75</p>
<p> Pretax			35.2		  vs  33.27</p>
<p> Turnover		   179.5		  vs 167.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Pretax profit includes exceptional bid costs in 1996/97 of 1.1 million stg. Earnings per share before exceptional bid costs was 16.8 pence versus 15.0 pence.</p>
<p>Full name of casino operator - London Clubs International Plc. -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
